template:
(id,group)=>{
const c=load("redesign_characters")[id],g=groups[group];
return `Use case: style-transfer. Asset type: production animation atlas for a 16-bit pixel-art fighting game.
Redraw and animate ${c.name} to match the identity and body proportions of the attached NEW motion atlas exactly. ${c.subject}
Crisp hard pixel clusters, detailed SNK-era hand-drawn pixel sprite. NO blur, NO antialias, no gradients, no painterly skin. Each body has adult proportions, two arms and two legs. Every frame faces RIGHT, 3/4 face. Preserve identity in every reaction. No rival or props.
Output EXACTLY 16 full-body frames in EXACT 4 columns × 4 rows. Square high-resolution sheet. Each row is one animation in four distinct successive frames. Use equal cell dimensions. Constant head/torso size; standing height 85% of cell height, feet centered and at 95% height. All hands, feet and clothing fully inside cells with margin. Transparent background, NO checkerboard, no grid, no text, no white residue, no shadows. NO effects baked into the sprite. Four real different poses per row, never duplicates.
${(group==='specials'?specials[id]:g.rows).map((r,i)=>'Row '+(i+1)+': '+r).join('\n')}
Keep the same anatomical scale even crouched or horizontal; do not enlarge compact poses to fill the cell. Long kicks and horizontal fallen bodies fit fully in cell. No cropping.`;
}
